.org/Niddah_42a.4"},"reference":"Niddah 42a:4","assessment":"The checked passage directly has Shmuel bar Bisna questioning Abaye about the legal classification of an emission.","evidence":[{"reference":"Niddah 42a:4","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Niddah_42a.4"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]},{"id":"3369:1:link-005","he":[126,141],"en":[217,230],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Ketubot_100a.1"},"reference":"Ketubot 100a:1","assessment":"The checked folio gives Shmuel bar Bisna in Rav Naḥman’s name, with the separate competing report by Rava.","evidence":[{"reference":"Ketubot 100a:1","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Ketubot_100a.1"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Ketubot 100a:3","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Ketubot_100a.3"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]}],"inlineHebrew":[0,2,3,4],"holds":[],"notes":[{"text":"Rashi glosses qavastan as “you have distressed me.” The Arukh also reports an anger gloss and cites R. Ḥananel’s “you deceived us.”","references":[],"urls":[]}],"comparisonEvidence":[{"reference":"Rashi on Kiddushin 26b:2:2","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Rashi_on_Kiddushin_26b.2.2"},"witness":"Vilna Edition"},{"reference":"Sefer He-Arukh, s.v. qavastan","target":{"url":"https://wiki.jewishbooks.org.il/mediawiki/wiki/ספר_הערוך/קבסתן"},"witness":"Sefer He-Arukh, s.v. qavastan"}]}],"entryEvidence":[]}
